  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large ttukbaegi earthenware pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the garlic and onion and cook until the onion is translucent.",
    "Add the pork and cook until browned on all sides.",
    "Add the lemon juice, tomato paste, fish sauce, black pepper, and salt, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the vine leaves and cook until wilted.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer for 30 minutes.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional lemon juice and vine leaves if desired.",
    "Cook the kaldereta in the ttukbaegi earthenware pot for an additional 10 minutes to allow the flavors to meld together."
